      "title": "Lessons Learned",
      "pageStart": 9,
      "pageEnd": 10,
      "target": "../sections/sec-011-lessons-learned.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Overall, the highly collaborative process of translating the requirements of those who do the work into \ntools and documents that can be easily understood by others has proven very effective. Despite some \nminor challenges in the initial creation of the tools, all participants felt they were able to contribute and \nthat their contribution was represented. This will have implications far beyond improving the \ndevelopment process. Including domain experts, actual clinicians and others who do the work, as well as \ndevelopers and those who will help architect the solutions addresses some of the mo",
